{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28776","headline":"句 · 杜牧","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人听达曙，聊罢苏牀琴。\n鱼多知海熟，药少觉山贫。\n土控吴兼越，州连歙与池。\n山河地襟带，军镇国藩维。\n绿水櫂云月，洞庭归路长。\n春桥垂酒幔，夜栅集茶樯。\n箬影沈溪暖，苹花遶郭香。\n经冬野菜青青色，未腊山梅树树花。\n半破前峰月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}